  "description": "Compact open-source ultrasound board pairing an iCE40 FPGA with a Raspberry Pi to provide pulse-echo acquisition for imaging experiments. A small, affordable, fully documented hardware platform for building and learning ultrasound, from the echOmods open-ultrasound family.",
